      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but I want to be sure. Sometimes these \"strategic disconnects\" are just polite ways of saying people don't like each other. Did you pick up on any actual personal friction or specific complaints from either of them during your sessions? Like, anything that isn't about the budget at all? I just want to know if we're dealing with a math problem or a personality problem before I step in.",
